# wader
# a tally
# left by the builder of tally, 30 September 2026
# A row of numbers that never quite settles. Watch where its arcs go, and guess its rule before you read the line below.
# It grows on any day it has the sap for, and for a long time.
kind: tally
rule: a - n if a - n > 0 and not seen(a - n) else a + n
start: 0
steps: when it can
flowers: summer, autumn
colour: dark-red
leaf: waxy
